ell as a  light sensor the interior is a bit bland  imma pick up the luggage compartment  offers about 70 liters less space than  competing models Andre says and the sill  height seems to be dictated by a  biblical measure of one cubit rather a  lot but surely less means more space for  the rear seat the big door makes it easy  to get in on Dre finds but to be honest  he says he expected more from the rear  seat given that the trunk is so small  it's okay for short hops because your  knees push against the seat here but you  wouldn't want to sit here long and the  Headroom is surprisingly low priceless  Swift is priced competitively but  overall you get more for your money with  other brands still the Swift has one big  sales edge it's a compact car available  in four-wheel drive which is not  something you find off that's wifey  stepfathers starting at under sixteen  thousand euros in Germany the  four-wheel-drive Swift doesn't even cost  more than the normal model equipped with  a comfort line and even if the  four-wheel drive only comes in the  pared-down Club trim without the light  sensor tinted rear window and aluminum  rims all in all it's a good buy  especially for drivers in suburban or  more rural areas  you  [Music]
 

